{
    "background_story": "Kieran was a gentle soul with a deep connection to nature. As a young apprentice to the village healer, he spent most of his days learning about the medicinal properties of plants. Among his favorites was feverfew, a humble herb with remarkable healing powers. Kieran would often venture into the nearby woods to harvest feverfew, using it to create remedies for the villagers' ailments. His knowledge and skill with the herb earned him the nickname 'Feverfew Kieran.' One summer, a severe outbreak of migraines afflicted the village, and Kieran's feverfew remedies proved to be the only effective treatment. The villagers were forever grateful, and Kieran's reputation as a skilled herbalist spread far and wide. His love for feverfew remained a constant, a symbol of his dedication to healing and helping others.",
